# W10, host a (k5): hosts a Public instance in stag0101; once b joined and played along a while, a removes b (the
# Instance page's Remove, INSTANCE_OP remove) and plays on alone; it stays (the instance runs) while b comes back.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=1200 fail stagechange
log b joined a
remove b
log a removed b
wander -150 -60 20 until present=1 fail stagechange
log b is gone
wander -150 -60 20 until epoch>=@480 fail stagechange
log a still hosts
